l_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124419","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124419.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124419.patch","merged_at":"2026-10-14T02:58:18Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #124352\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nImplement the first part of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123040#discussion_r4237607779 to solve the engine crash when changing the member type in hot reload.\r\n\r\nDone with a simple boolean check to see if the old type is the same as the new type, and not assigning it its old value.\r\n\r\nIf the type is not compatible with the value, the default value for the `Variant` type is used instead.\r\n\r\nMoved `get_default_variant_for_data_type` from `gdscript_function` to a public static method in a dedicated `gdscript_helper` class. This class can be extended in the future as more helpers are needed.\r\n\r\nTested with the code from the MRP and it no longer causes the engine crash.\r\n\r\nNo AI has been used for this PR whatsoever.\r\n\r\n## Video demos\r\n\r\n### Master branch\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/67332fd2-e8ca-4db1-bfe1-f64fb84f08f5\r\n\r\n### New behavior\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/707d404f-b81f-4e19-976d-2644376ca09d\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124419/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124419/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}